{"3965220": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Stranded Survivors", "steam_appid": 3965220, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WISHLIST NOW!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965220/extras/dfb41f97152f0c71edd3a8a83f26cc0c.poster.avif?t=1778176265\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965220/extras/dfb41f97152f0c71edd3a8a83f26cc0c.webm?t=1778176265\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965220/extras/dfb41f97152f0c71edd3a8a83f26cc0c.mp4?t=1778176265\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > In <u><strong>Stranded Survivors</strong></u> your goal is to survive the swarms of monsters that are coming while trying to reach and rescue stranded animals that need YOUR help. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Monsters are Coming!</strong> Weave through <strong>endless waves</strong> of monsters, scoop up XP, and choose upgrades that transform modest starts into screen-melting builds. Chase combos, experiment with passives, and <strong>scale into late-run dominance</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Rescue &amp; Recruit</strong>: Save animals and survivors mid-run to gain instant boosts and post-run upgrades. Each rescue adds meaningful power—companions, farmhands, and passive bonuses that stack fast in true bullet heaven fashion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965220/extras/55fa75d42672fa0d193a5b94a0495771.avif?t=1778176265\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965220/extras_big/55fa75d42672fa0d193a5b94a0495771.webp?t=1778176265 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Build Your Farm Between Runs</strong>: Every rescued Stranded Animal gives you resources to build shelters, fields, workshops, and more. Your farm is the meta—permanent buildings unlock perks, weapon blueprints, and synergies that reshape future runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Unlock Weapons &amp; Perks:</strong> Turn rescues into tangible progress—new weapons, evolutions, and perk paths that support brawler, summoner, or speed-farmer playstyles. Find the <strong>broken</strong> combos and break the horde.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Every Run Feels Different:</strong> <strong>Roguelite</strong> drops, escalating elites, and event modifiers keep tension high. Your <strong>farm meta</strong> steers long-term strategy while moment-to-moment choices decide if you make it out alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965220/extras/ab861d38e73c9d2b373aac8f628cf66d.poster.avif?t=1778176265\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965220/extras/ab861d38e73c9d2b373aac8f628cf66d.webm?t=1778176265\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965220/extras/ab861d38e73c9d2b373aac8f628cf66d.mp4?t=1778176265\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you strong enough to help them? <strong>Wishlist Stranded Survivors</strong> and help these animals (and your loadout) grow stronger with every run.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WISHLIST NOW!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\