 you resources to build shelters, fields, workshops, and more. Your farm is the meta—permanent buildings unlock perks, weapon blueprints, and synergies that reshape future runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Unlock Weapons &amp; Perks:</strong> Turn rescues into tangible progress—new weapons, evolutions, and perk paths that support brawler, summoner, or speed-farmer playstyles. Find the <strong>broken</strong> combos and break the horde.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Every Run Feels Different:</strong> <strong>Roguelite</strong> drops, escalating elites, and event modifiers keep tension high. Your <strong>farm meta</strong> steers long-term strategy while moment-to-moment choices decide if you make it out alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965220/extras/ab861d38e73c9d2b373aac8f628cf66d.poster.avif?t=1778176265\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965220/extras/ab861d38e73c9d2b373aac8f628cf66d.webm?t=1778176265\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965220/extras/ab861d38e73c9d2b373aac8f628cf66d.mp4?t=1778176265\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you strong enough to help them? <strong>Wishlist Stranded Survivors</strong> and help these animals (and your loadout) grow stronger with every run.</p>", "short_description": "Survive swarms of monsters, rescue stranded animals, and build a base where they can be safe in this unique bullet heaven. Turn your rescues into upgrades and build a safe town to create new weapons and recruit powerful heroes that unlock new ways to survive til dawn.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*<